<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>BGTaskSchedulerPermittedIdentifiers</key>
	<array>
		<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER).task.*</string>
	</array>
	<key>CADisableMinimumFrameDurationOnPhone</key>
	<true/>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>en</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>Fish Pocket</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleLocalizations</key>
	<array>
		<string>zh-Hans</string>
		<string>zh-Hant</string>
		<string>en</string>
		<string>es</string>
		<string>ja</string>
		<string>ko</string>
	</array>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>APPL</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
	<key>CFBundleURLTypes</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>CFBundleURLName</key>
			<string>com.wsw.dsh-ios</string>
			<key>CFBundleURLSchemes</key>
			<array>
				<string>$(DSH_URL_SCHEME)</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
	<key>DshAppGroup</key>
	<string>$(DSH_APP_GROUP)</string>
	<key>DshURLScheme</key>
	<string>$(DSH_URL_SCHEME)</string>
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<false/>
	<key>NSAlarmKitUsageDescription</key>
	<string>让智能体按你的要求设真正的闹钟。闹钟会穿透静音和专注模式，响到你关掉为止。</string>
	<key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSAllowsArbitraryLoadsInWebContent</key>
		<true/>
		<key>NSAllowsLocalNetworking</key>
		<true/>
	</dict>
	<key>NSAppleMusicUsageDescription</key>
	<string>让智能体按你的要求在音乐资料库里找歌和歌单，并控制播放。为回答你的问题，歌曲和歌单的名称会随对话发送给你选择的模型服务商。</string>
	<key>NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>让智能体按你的要求查看和安排日程。为回答你的问题，相关日程内容会随对话发送给你选择的模型服务商。</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>拍照后作为附件发给智能体，或扫描电脑上的登录二维码。</string>
	<key>NSContactsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>让智能体在你要求时按名字、电话或邮箱查找联系人，比如替你写邮件前查对方的地址。为回答你的问题，查到的联系人信息会随对话发送给你选择的模型服务商。App 不会添加、修改或删除任何联系人。</string>
	<key>NSHealthShareUsageDescription</key>
	<string>让智能体在你问起时读取你的健康数据，比如步数、睡眠、心率。为回答你的问题，读到的数值会随对话发送给你选择的模型服务商。App 不会写入或修改任何健康数据。</string>
	<key>NSHealthUpdateUsageDescription</key>
	<string>这个版本不会向「健康」写入或修改任何数据。</string>
	<key>NSHomeKitUsageDescription</key>
	<string>让智能体按你的要求查看家里的配件和它们的状态，并按你设的写入方式改状态或执行场景。为回答你的问题，配件名称和状态会随对话发送给你选择的模型服务商。</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>让智能体在你问「我在哪」「附近有什么」时读取一次当前位置。只在用到时读，不会持续记录。为回答你的问题，位置会随对话发送给你选择的模型服务商。</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>按住输入栏说话时录音，把语音转成文字。录音直接发送给你在「语音输入」里设置的火山引擎识别服务，App 不保存录音；松手后识别出的文字会随对话发送给你选择的模型服务商。</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
	<string>把分享海报和交流群二维码保存到相册。</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>让智能体在你问起时查看相册里有哪些照片、导出照片给本机识别，并按你在「本机能力」里设的写入方式帮你整理相册。为回答你的问题，相关信息会随对话发送给你选择的模型服务商。删除照片前 iOS 会再问你一次。</string>
	<key>NSRemindersFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>让智能体按你的要求查看和创建提醒。为回答你的问题，相关提醒内容会随对话发送给你选择的模型服务商。</string>
	<key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>让智能体在你要求时读出录音文件里说了什么。默认只在本机识别，录音不离开手机；只有在明确指定云端识别时，录音才会发送给 Apple 的服务器。为回答你的问题，转写出的文字会随对话发送给你选择的模型服务商。这项能力不录音，也不使用麦克风。</string>
	<key>NSSupportsLiveActivities</key>
	<true/>
	<key>NSUserActivityTypes</key>
	<array>
		<string>INSendMessageIntent</string>
	</array>
	<key>UIApplicationSceneManifest</key>
	<dict>
		<key>UIApplicationSupportsMultipleScenes</key>
		<true/>
	</dict>
	<key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
	<array>
		<string>audio</string>
	</array>
	<key>UILaunchScreen</key>
	<dict>
		<key>UIColorName</key>
		<string>Background</string>
		<key>UIImageName</key>
		<string>LaunchMark</string>
		<key>UIImageRespectsSafeAreaInsets</key>
		<false/>
	</dict>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations~ipad</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortraitUpsideDown</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
